MODULE: BindingHeldCheckpointLogicalPin
TARGET: BindingHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: checkpoint banking withdraws the bound physical pin rather than reporting its floor
PERTURBS: Checkpoint

--- FIND
    /\ checkpoint' = read /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![bound] = read]
--- REPLACE
    /\ checkpoint' = read /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![bound] = -1]
--- END
